DESCRIPTION:Dadrock: Brenden MC vs Dance DJ Club Night!! Craft & local beverages for purchase as well!\n🎧 DADROCK: Brenden MC vs Dance! 🎧\nThis one’s for the heads and the dance floor.\nJoin us at The Passenger for a club night packed with glitch\, bass\, breaks\, house\, and techno as Brenden MC and Dance! go back-to-back. These two have been rocking underground scenes across multiple states since the late ’90s—expect deep cuts\, heavy grooves\, and the occasional “wait… I know that sample 👀” moment.\n🍸 Eclectic cocktails\n🍺 Local craft beer & liquor\n🍽️ Snacks late\, full dinner menu early\nCome early for dinner\, stay late for the beats\, and let the night take off.\nNo frills—just good music\, good drinks\, and a packed dance floor. ✨🕺\n\nLink: https://www.downtownlongmont.com/do/dad-rock-club-night-the-passenger-restaurant
